Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.86,0:00:08.78,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The leadership course starts today.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.40,0:00:12.65,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,All of the class reps and event planners will be attending.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:12.65,0:00:15.62,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,It'll be an overnight training camp! {it wasn't clear how many nights}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.58,0:00:28.34,callig,,0,0,0,,{\fs20\blur0.6\c&HC8C5C3&\move(1196,354.667,1116,353.667)}Tanaka
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.67,0:00:31.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Are you asleep? Don't tell me you're still sleeping!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.46,0:00:33.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come on, Kou! Wake up!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:35.22,0:00:37.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I bet you just got out of bed.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.35,0:00:39.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I even called to make sure you woke—
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.06,0:00:45.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're such a nag.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.23,0:00:51.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why are you naked?!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:10.30,0:01:12.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I didn't come here for {\i1}that{\i0}!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.96,0:01:15.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? Is your brain working?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:17.05,0:01:19.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Who would even want to lay a hand on you?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:19.80,0:01:22.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You woke the whole town up with your screaming.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:22.31,0:01:24.39,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,B-B-But, naked!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:24.39,0:01:26.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was about to shower.{retimed; false keyframe}
Dialogue: 10,0:01:28.44,0:01:29.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I was so off!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:30.11,0:01:32.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Please just kill me!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:33.74,0:01:37.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Wait, you're gonna shower now? There's no time!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:37.66,0:01:39.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You worry too much.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.45,0:01:40.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just wait in here.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:40.83,0:01:42.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then get a move on!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:43.24,0:01:45.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That hurt, you know.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:47.62,0:01:49.54,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Kou's bare skin.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:50.08,0:01:52.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I did not mean to do that.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:52.42,0:01:56.13,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I-It was pretty smooth.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:57.09,0:01:59.84,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Does he use product or something?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:11.15,0:02:13.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's really tidy in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:25.20,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\c&H172733&\fs33\b1\fax.3\blur0.6\frz343\pos(732,44)}Youichi 4 y.o.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:25.20,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\c&H172733&\fs33\fax.3\b1\blur0.6\frz343\pos(729.334,154.667)}Kou 4 y.o.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:25.20,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\c&H253C4B&\fs33\fax.3\b1\blur0.6\pos(778.667,425.333)\frz339.7}Kou 3 y.o.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.74,0:02:25.20,thin straight hand,,0,0,0,,{\c&H253C4B&\fs33\fax.3\b1\blur0.6\frz339.7\pos(700,565.333)}Youichi 3 y.o.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:27.50,0:02:29.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:29.17,0:02:30.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, right.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.88,0:02:32.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Man, that {\i1}was{\i0} fast.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.88,0:02:34.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:35.84,audition sign,,0,0,0,,{\fs13\fax.2\blur0.5\c&HABABAB&\frz20.87\pos(747.2,480.933)}Cooking Basics
Dialogue: 10,0:02:39.30,0:02:42.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,See? We made it with time to spare.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:42.93,0:02:44.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just barely.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.35,0:02:48.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I like having a bit extra ti—
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.43,0:02:49.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:52.61,0:02:54.86,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't believe you left your bag at my house!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.86,0:02:56.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Forgive me!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.73,0:02:59.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Stop slacking, Kou! Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:59.57,0:03:02.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why don't {\i1}you{\i0} try running with this?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:07.37,0:03:08.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The train's leaving!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.83,0:03:10.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Guess we'll have to wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:10.62,0:03:11.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's grab the next one.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:12.42,0:03:14.75,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't you give up on me!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:18.97,0:03:20.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Made it...
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.80,0:03:24.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Where were we meeting up again...{what are you, indian?}
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.47,0:03:28.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Pretty sure it was Oosakigaoka Station.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.48,0:03:31.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oosakigaoka's in the other direction.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:34.27,0:03:39.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I messed up! I got on the train\N I take to school out of habit!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.24,0:03:42.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,This one's a super express train, so we'll be stuck here for a while.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:44.62,0:03:48.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Yuuri!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:48.91,0:03:51.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hello, Futaba-chan? Where are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.58,0:03:55.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry! I bet everyone's already there!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.59,0:03:59.55,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tanaka-sensei, I know that blaming you won't get me anywhere,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:00.09,0:04:03.26,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,but you need to keep a closer eye on your students!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.26,0:04:05.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:05.51,0:04:10.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well I'm not waiting! Tell them to find a map and get there themselves!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.14,0:04:12.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:17.32,0:04:20.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I feel spent already.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.65,0:04:22.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's what I want to say.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:26.37,0:04:28.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou, go ahead and nap.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.79,0:04:30.58,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You don't mind?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.58,0:04:33.83,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I'll wake you when we get there.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.83,0:04:36.33,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll take you up on that.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:40.05,0:04:42.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,This girl's unbelievable.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:12.97,0:06:17.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You two... make sure this is the last time!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:17.44,0:06:18.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.77,0:06:19.52,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.19,0:06:23.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Now get your butts changed and go get some lunch.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:23.27,0:06:25.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm really sorry...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:36.08,0:06:37.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You two...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.66,0:06:43.71,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,When both of our class reps are late, {\i1}we're{\i0} the ones who look bad!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.71,0:06:46.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yeah... sorry again.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.92,0:06:48.84,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:49.72,0:06:53.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're going to have to write an essay reflecting on why you were late.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.01,0:06:55.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Bring it in before lights-out.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.73,0:06:59.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You too, Yoshioka.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:59.48,0:07:01.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Uh, right...{she's not british}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:04.15,0:07:07.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Christ, now I've gotta write an essay...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.11,0:07:13.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,When you cause trouble like this, it reflects badly on Tanaka-sensei as well.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.82,0:07:16.29,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Watch yourself from now on.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.87,0:07:19.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Whatever, he's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.29,0:07:23.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's my business. He has nothing to do with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.00,0:07:27.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,He has nothing to do with it, yet he had to apologize on your behalf?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:28.09,0:07:29.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You child.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.05,0:07:32.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.51,0:07:33.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Spoiled brat.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.56,0:07:39.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,M-Murao-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:39.14,0:07:44.98,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,O-Oh yeah! I was really surprised that you volunteered to be an event planner.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:44.98,0:07:47.07,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Do you like this kind of thing?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:47.07,0:07:48.15,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:48.94,0:07:51.53,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Then why'd you do it?!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.53,0:07:57.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You've got a big mouth for someone so bad at talking to people.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.03,0:07:57.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:58.62,0:08:02.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't talk to girls like that. {dis KENN white knight}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.58,0:08:06.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey guys, let's all just calm down.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.00,0:08:07.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm finished.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:08.75,0:08:10.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Same here.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.05,0:08:11.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.30,0:08:13.59,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What just happened?{...}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.22,0:08:17.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan, don't let that get you down.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:17.64,0:08:19.72,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.18,0:08:23.85,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Well, at least Yuuri's nice.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:23.85,0:08:25.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That was good.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:25.27,0:08:27.27,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What a wonderful meal.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.27,0:08:29.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,If you don't want it I'll take it.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.78,0:08:34.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I was specially saving it for later...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.57,0:08:41.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Curse you... I will have my vengeance...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:41.41,0:08:42.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What happened to you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.21,0:08:51.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Thoughts, anyone?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.17,0:08:51.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao-san?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:51.96,0:08:53.13,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I have nothing to say.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.13,0:08:53.88,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yuuri?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.88,0:08:55.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh? Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.97,0:08:57.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kominato-kun?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.22,0:08:59.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Cool, orienteering tomorrow. {I remember someone getting shit over using this word, but until we know what they're doing we have to assume it's right}
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.93,0:09:01.22,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.14,0:09:05.73,lawless,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.6\bord3\fs70\shad1\4a&HCC&\3c&H27CBEE&\1c&H27C7EA&\pos(654.667,177)}No authority{\alpha&HFF&\t(280,280,\alpha&H00&\4a&HCC&)} whatsoever
Dialogue: 1,0:09:02.14,0:09:05.73,lawless,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.6\fs70\c&H000000&\4a&HCC&\pos(654.667,177)}No authority{\alpha&HFF&\t(280,280,\alpha&H00&\4a&HCC&} whatsoever
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.23,0:09:05.73,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,They're so useless...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.73,0:09:11.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Come on, say something! "What do you believe the purpose of school events is?"
Dialogue: 10,0:09:11.23,0:09:14.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We might be picked to present on it later!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.82,0:09:17.32,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just write something noncommittal. {this is in preparation for later}
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.25,0:09:27.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Which class wants to go first?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.67,0:09:31.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's see... how about 2-2?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:34.67,0:09:36.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Futaba-chan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.18,0:09:38.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, didn't you write something?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:38.59,0:09:40.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just say that.
