Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.44,0:09:48.90,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's wrong? Hurry up.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:50.31,0:09:51.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.77,0:09:53.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Let's see...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.40,0:09:56.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,In regard to school events,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:57.91,0:10:03.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,we believe that when students partake in events with objectives that can only be accomplished in a group,
Dialogue: 10,0:10:03.79,0:10:06.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,they will feel a sense of community belonging
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.46,0:10:12.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,and be more inclined to cooperate with their classmates.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:07.21,0:10:13.25,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I can't believe how well he can make stuff up on the spot.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.30,0:10:17.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Very good. Next up is...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:17.63,0:10:19.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just a moment.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.76,0:10:23.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like I completely understand your point.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.97,0:10:26.43,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You are the biggest pain.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.35,0:10:30.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why do you believe cooperation is so important?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.44,0:10:33.44,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What? Well, that's...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:34.32,0:10:40.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Cooperation allows for accomplishments greater than those one can achieve alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.41,0:10:43.37,handwrite3,,0,0,0,,{\frz344.3\fs52\blur0.6\c&H4D4C4C&\pos(688.999,459.666)}Fun memories!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.50,0:10:50.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Kou?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.54,0:10:53.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,One day...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.25,0:11:00.01,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,One day, when we look back on this, I want everyone who shared this experience
Dialogue: 10,0:11:00.01,0:11:04.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,to remember these warm and fun times.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:06.43,0:11:08.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sounds good to me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:08.14,0:11:10.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You can sit down now.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.98,0:11:15.94,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You look like a deer in headlights.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.94,0:11:18.28,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're the one who wrote it.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.84,0:11:41.38,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Yoshioka?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:41.68,0:11:43.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You write your essay yet?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.35,0:11:48.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not a word, huh.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.97,0:11:51.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just write something noncommittal.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.81,0:11:55.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You really amaze me, Kou.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.48,0:11:56.61,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How so?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.61,0:11:59.82,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Everything comes so naturally to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.82,0:12:01.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I try my hardest, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:03.28,0:12:06.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It just always seems to come back and bite me.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.70,0:12:10.41,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I want to be more like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.25,0:12:13.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Why do I keep failing?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.67,0:12:15.00,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm so frustrated.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.13,0:12:22.34,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to be.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.97,0:12:27.60,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's not that I'm good at things, I'm just noncommittal.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.31,0:12:32.06,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You just see me that way because I couldn't care less.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.65,0:12:37.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But the fact that you're so beat up over this
Dialogue: 10,0:12:38.19,0:12:41.11,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,is proof that you're not satisfied with where you are.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:48.16,0:12:49.08,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,So don't—
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.71,0:13:04.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A-Anyway, I think you've really got it all together.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.55,0:13:09.68,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,And you don't think you do?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:11.02,0:13:14.69,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm just kind of good at going with the flow.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:16.69,0:13:18.81,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The back of his neck looked as familiar as ever,{this line was also extended}
Dialogue: 10,0:13:22.82,0:13:25.99,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,but the words he said were not from someone I knew.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.66,0:13:29.49,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm fine the way things are.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:31.16,0:13:32.20,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,For some reason...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.37,0:13:35.79,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...I feel like crying right now.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.37,0:13:40.38,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What made him change this much?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.38,0:13:42.42,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I want to know.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:43.55,0:13:48.89,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,What happened to Kou in the three years we were separated?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.85,0:13:52.14,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I want to know.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.18,0:13:57.69,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,How did he take all the things that happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:00.19,0:14:01.36,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What're you doing?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.40,0:14:04.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just a second.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.00,0:14:17.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hey, listen.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:18.46,0:14:19.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Tell me...{either the duration on these two lines needs to be longer or the lines need to be shorter (or both)}
Dialogue: 10,0:14:21.54,0:14:22.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Do you love me?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.35,0:14:44.11,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I want to know more about Kou, but is that love?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.78,0:14:49.07,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Are my feelings towards the old Kou... or the new one?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:50.16,0:14:54.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,D-Did you really just say that?! \NHow full of yourself are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.49,0:14:57.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Don't be crazy.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.04,0:15:00.54,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,The only reason I asked was because you were stroking my head.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.13,0:15:04.80,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just so you know, I don't feel a single thing for you.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.13,0:15:08.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You confused the heck out of me back there.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:08.67,0:15:10.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I just had to make sure.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:10.76,0:15:15.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't like how you are now at all either.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.10,0:15:18.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's just...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:19.48,0:15:25.73,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,When I think about how you used to be, I can't help but wonder how you, well...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.69,0:15:29.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Something inside me just can't accept—
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.03,0:15:30.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You've changed just as much as me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:32.07,0:15:34.87,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Stop looking for the old me already.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:35.70,0:15:37.70,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's just depressing.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:41.67,0:15:46.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Also, for someone pretending to try so hard to move forward,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:46.59,0:15:48.51,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,you sure do cling to the past.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.01,0:15:50.92,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.05,0:15:56.72,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Wh-What the heck?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:58.27,0:15:59.52,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I knew it...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.56,0:16:05.19,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,The Kou today is not the one I love! {she caught the Yuu-chan}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.91,0:16:21.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How immature.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:21.50,0:16:24.25,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What, you two fighting?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.25,0:16:25.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:24.25,0:16:25.21,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Not really.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.46,0:16:29.42,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,That's exactly the kind of thing a couple would do!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.42,0:16:31.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Who'd go out with {\i1}that{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.42,0:16:31.30,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Who'd go out with {\i1}that{\i0}?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.30,0:16:35.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I can't tell if you're the same or total opposites. {asdkufhb}
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.14,0:16:35.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.97,0:16:42.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'm going to clean over there.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:42.18,0:16:43.77,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What's with her?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.77,0:16:45.40,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She clearly hates you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:43.77,0:16:45.40,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,She clearly hates you.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.15,0:16:48.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're not really fighting, are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:52.57,0:16:54.32,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,My cupcake...
