Dialogue: 10,0:17:02.16,0:17:05.50,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Go help the others, Murao.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:06.12,0:17:08.21,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,They have enough people over there.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:09.34,0:17:10.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I'll stay.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.92,0:17:16.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao, you need to get along with the others.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.72,0:17:19.81,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You can't say that you're be fine alone
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.81,0:17:23.18,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,until you've put in the effort to making a place for yourself.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.93,0:17:26.10,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I am putting in the effort.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.69,0:17:36.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao, I'm a teacher.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:36.95,0:17:40.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I won't leave you as long as you're my student.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:41.20,0:17:44.45,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But in the same vein, we can't get any closer.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:46.46,0:17:47.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I've told you that many times.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.76,0:17:55.59,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Murao.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.18,0:18:00.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Go join everyone else.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:21.62,0:18:22.91,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:32.46,0:18:34.05,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Damn Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.01,0:18:38.97,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Why am I so pissed off?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.80,0:18:41.14,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're pathetic.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:43.72,0:18:47.23,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Oh... it's because he was right.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.39,0:18:52.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He may have been right, but I'm \N\Nstill doing my best to change.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.23,0:18:57.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,All I need to do is keep moving forward! Yeah!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:57.94,0:18:59.82,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,First, I should make up with Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.41,0:19:06.62,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Ah, Kou!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.84,0:19:16.30,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I-Is she confessing to him?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:17.01,0:19:19.47,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,She totally is!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.93,0:19:29.10,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,He went and called me pathetic, and now he's grinning like an idiot at that girl!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.10,0:19:30.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:33.48,0:19:35.57,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,E-Excuse me!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:35.57,0:19:36.48,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You a second-year?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.48,0:19:38.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well aren't you aggressive!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.19,0:19:39.65,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Um, no...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.65,0:19:41.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're pretty cute.\N
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.15,0:19:41.99,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap, third-years...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:41.99,0:19:44.12,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Oh, you must want to ask me out!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.12,0:19:44.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:44.66,0:19:46.03,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No, it must be me.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:46.03,0:19:48.16,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Doofus, there's no way.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:48.16,0:19:49.20,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Same to you.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:49.54,0:19:51.04,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Then who's it gonna be?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It's me, man!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.04,0:19:52.17,AoHaru alt,,0,0,0,,Excuse me...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.67,0:19:58.09,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:58.09,0:20:01.17,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,This is my girlfriend.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:04.18,0:20:05.30,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.30,0:20:07.93,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,We didn't really mean to...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:07.93,0:20:09.02,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:09.60,0:20:10.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Well then.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:16.57,0:20:18.53,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What're you doing, stupid?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.53,0:20:21.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,It just kinda... happened.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.99,0:20:23.95,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How does {\i1}that{\i0} happen?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.45,0:20:25.66,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,You're the one who—
Dialogue: 10,0:20:25.66,0:20:27.78,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,What? What did I do?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.29,0:20:33.96,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Sorry. I was just trying to shift the blame.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:45.14,0:20:48.76,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,How long are you going to hold my hand?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.14,0:20:50.35,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,A bit longer.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:51.43,0:20:53.23,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Just bear with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.89,0:20:57.19,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,I don't really... mind that much...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.06,0:21:02.99,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,But you might get in trouble... if someone sees us...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.86,0:21:09.24,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,L-Like... your girlfriend, or something.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.16,0:21:13.46,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,She might get the wrong impression.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.42,0:21:18.79,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,No worries. I don't have anyone like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:20.13,0:21:22.67,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,O-Oh, okay then.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:22.67,0:21:25.63,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Huh, never mind then.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:32.89,0:21:33.98,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:35.60,0:21:38.44,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,I feel like a load's off my shoulders.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:38.94,0:21:42.57,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Huh? Why can a single thing Kou says
Dialogue: 10,0:21:42.57,0:21:45.36,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,make me depressed or relieved?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.53,0:21:49.03,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,Even though, right now...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:49.66,0:21:52.70,AoHaru ital,,0,0,0,,...I don't even love Kou or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.00,0:23:40.02,next time,,0,0,0,,{\1c&HDFB045&\bord3\blur3\3c&HE3B43C&\pos(219.429,138.571)}NEXT TIME...
