Dialogue: 10,0:23:28.17,0:23:31.64,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Hyper goin' now, yo yo yo!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:31.64,0:23:34.97,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Super orienteering!
Dialogue: 10,0:23:34.97,0:23:39.31,AoHaru,,0,0,0,,Get 'dem points along the way!
